    "page_content": "1. Purpose\nThis policy defines the methodology used to measure the value of Order Intake for multi-element arrangements,\nincluding allocation of contract value across deliverables using Standalone Selling Price (SSP).\n2. Scope\nApplies to all multi-element customer arrangements combining:\n- Hardware/Software (HW/SW) deliverables, AND\n- Services deliverables\n3. Definitions\nStandalone Selling Price (SSP): The price at which the Company would sell a deliverable separately under similar\ncircumstances.\n4. Roles and Responsibilities",
