    "page_content": "5. SSP Allocation Methodology\n5.1 Calculation Basis\nAllocation is performed using the Standalone List Price method. Each deliverable is allocated a share of total contract\nvalue based on its list price relative to total list price of all deliverables. No weighting adjustment is applied.\n5.2 Allocation Formula\nSSP Allocation (Deliverable) = (List Price of Deliverable ÷ Total List Price of All Deliverables) × Total Contract Value\n6. Sample Allocation Illustration",
